(7108338, 1083376, 138630, '<td valign="top">One of my very favorites - I absolutely adore the find!  I''m torn between liking the subdued presentation and wishing for more pop, especially in the wonderful textures.  Voted earlier; back to comment.</td>', 'One of my very favorites - I absolutely adore the find!  I''m torn between liking the subdued presentation and wishing for more pop, especially in the wonderful textures.  Voted earlier; back to comment.', '2013-09-29 12:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7108339, 1083305, 138630, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and the words on words look of this one.  Wish it didn''t have those two mitered corners.  Still one of my top picks.  Voted earlier; back to comment.</td>', 'Love the colors and the words on words look of this one.  Wish it didn''t have those two mitered corners.  Still one of my top picks.  Voted earlier; back to comment.', '2013-09-29 12:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7108340, 1083367, 138630, '<td valign="top">Love this one - top pick from me and I suspect many others.  Very nicely composed, perfect in black and white, and gets an extra point for nostalgia - my parents were both journalists and newspaper people and the rapid clicking of manual typewriter keys will always be in my auditory memory.  Voted earlier; back to comment.</td>', 'Love this one - top pick from me and I suspect many others.  Very nicely composed, perfect in black and white, and gets an extra point for nostalgia - my parents were both journalists and newspaper people and the rapid clicking of manual typewriter keys will always be in my auditory memory.  Voted earlier; back to comment.', '2013-09-29 12:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
