(7108509, 1083469, 129807, '<td valign="top">I can''t vote on this, but I''ll leave you a comment...<br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bohemka:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Damon:</b></div><hr/><i> Was really hoping to get several comments rather than a decent score considering the subject matter, oh well! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Very nice!<br/>I would have leveled the horizon, but whatever<br/>STUNNING<br/>What are the cats supposed to represent? I don''t get it.<br/>A tad over-cooked but in my top 35. Well done.<br/>DNMC<br/> <br/>Better? </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'I can''t vote on this, but I''ll leave you a comment...Originally posted by bohemka: Originally posted by Damon: Was really hoping to get several comments rather than a decent score considering the subject matter, oh well!  Very nice!I would have leveled the horizon, but whateverSTUNNINGWhat are the cats supposed to represent? I don''t get it.A tad over-cooked but in my top 35. Well done.DNMC Better? ', '2013-09-29 22:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
