(7108559, 1083694, 165399, '<td valign="top">Great pic!!! I love the creativity, inventiveness, and attention to detail. Keep it up...your portraits are my favorite! (especially the teacher -- so far -- but I expect more great portraits to come)<br/> <br/>P.S. - using a cracked egg for your nose...........Pure G-E-N-I-U-S!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1079504" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/165000-169999/165399/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1079504.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/165000-169999/165399/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1079504.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/165000-169999/165399/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1079504.jpg"/></a> You''re an all-star!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-09-30 04:54:26.</i></td>', 'Great pic!!! I love the creativity, inventiveness, and attention to detail. Keep it up...your portraits are my favorite! (especially the teacher -- so far -- but I expect more great portraits to come) P.S. - using a cracked egg for your nose...........Pure G-E-N-I-U-S!  You''re an all-star!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!', '2013-09-30 01:10:05.000000', '2013-09-30 05:54:26.000000', 0),
