(7109865, 1083595, 112136, '<td valign="top">That''s a good way of interpretation; and a powerful one at that.<br/>In my humble opinion a slight low key would make it more impactful - Dark side, Dark Image; just my thought. May be you can give it a try by post-processing again :)</td>', 'That''s a good way of interpretation; and a powerful one at that.In my humble opinion a slight low key would make it more impactful - Dark side, Dark Image; just my thought. May be you can give it a try by post-processing again :)', '2013-10-02 13:10:53.000000', NULL, 0),
