(7110481, 1083437, 117534, '<td valign="top">I''m late to the congrats party... but I had this in my first place slot! AMAZEING shot, edit, and OMG there is a Mr Potato head!  My only critique is I wasn''t sitting beside u!!!! WOW Chicago and a Blue... Life don''t get no better!!!!!</td>', 'I''m late to the congrats party... but I had this in my first place slot! AMAZEING shot, edit, and OMG there is a Mr Potato head!  My only critique is I wasn''t sitting beside u!!!! WOW Chicago and a Blue... Life don''t get no better!!!!!', '2013-10-03 13:53:32.000000', NULL, 0),
