(7110836, 1083656, 113411, '<td valign="top">Thank you guys for the ribbon and for your your really nice<br/>comments. I was shooting with Steve Hill<br/>( pawdrix) in  Brooklyn when we came across this boy/man<br/>and his dog, Lucy.  He was happy to pose for us and his sign<br/>met the challenge. <br/>I hope that  he will  find help and recover. <br/>Thanks again to my friends and teammates!<br/>Jane</td>', 'Thank you guys for the ribbon and for your your really nicecomments. I was shooting with Steve Hill( pawdrix) in  Brooklyn when we came across this boy/manand his dog, Lucy.  He was happy to pose for us and his signmet the challenge. I hope that  he will  find help and recover. Thanks again to my friends and teammates!Jane', '2013-10-04 06:26:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7111460, 1083593, 1897, '<td valign="top">great image, I am surprised it didn''t end up higher.</td>', 'great image, I am surprised it didn''t end up higher.', '2013-10-05 13:28:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7111478, 1083437, 16106, '<td valign="top">It''s funny how some images are just worth going back to over and over. I liked the capture before the edit, I like this edit more and thought it would do well. Since it has been hanging out on the front page I keep giving it another look, and it rewards that attention every time. The ribbon is nice, but this is just one of those shots that works on so many levels that it just gets better on repeated viewings, and that is a very rare thing.</td>', 'It''s funny how some images are just worth going back to over and over. I liked the capture before the edit, I like this edit more and thought it would do well. Since it has been hanging out on the front page I keep giving it another look, and it rewards that attention every time. The ribbon is nice, but this is just one of those shots that works on so many levels that it just gets better on repeated viewings, and that is a very rare thing.', '2013-10-05 13:47:24.000000', NULL, 0),
